          <attvalue for="35" value="Intensified regulatory enforcement against Chinese-linked shipping and tech firms leads Beijing to increase naval/paramilitary escorts and presence around key energy choke points to protect national commerce, raising the frequency of risky close encounters and the perceived shipping transit risk." />
