          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Intensified regulatory actions against large cross-border platforms (content rules, takedown pressures) can fragment moderation practices and push users into smaller or encrypted channels with weaker moderation where Russian-origin disinformation spreads more freely, increasing prevalence in the conflict information space." />
