          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in U.S. legislative initiatives targeting Chinese tech actors prompts rapid diplomatic countermeasures and coordination by China (and affected third parties), producing a short-term rise in formal diplomatic contacts, mediations, and high-level exchanges related to Gulf security and economic fallout." />
